{
  "opencollection": "1.0.0",
  "info": {
    "name": "Remote Address Details Contract Amendments API",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "request": {
    "auth": {
      "type": "oauth2",
      "flow": "client_credentials",
      "accessTokenUrl": "/auth/oauth2/token",
      "credentials": {
        "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
        "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
      }
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Contract Amendments",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Show form schema",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/contract-amendments/schema",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "employment_id",
                "value": "31b8e49b-aa1c-47af-849c-3d0a53e20e0d",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The ID of the employment concerned by the contract amendment request."
              },
              {
                "name": "country_code",
                "value": "CAN",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Country code according to ISO 3-digit alphabetic codes."
              },
              {
                "name": "form",
                "value": "contract_amendment",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Name of the desired form"
              },
              {
                "name": "json_schema_version",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Version of the form schema"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns the json schema of the `contract_amendment` form for a specific employment.\nThis endpoint requires a company access token, as forms are dependent on certain\nproperties of companies and their current employments.\n\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage employments (`employments`) | View contract amendments (`contract_amendment:read`) | Manage contract amendments (`contract_amendment:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List Contract Amendment",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/contract-amendments",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "employment_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Employment ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "status",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Contract Amendment status"
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Starts fetching records after the given page"
              },
              {
                "name": "page_size",
                "value": "20",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Number of items per page"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "List Contract Amendment requests.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage employments (`employments`) | View contract amendments (`contract_amendment:read`) | Manage contract amendments (`contract_amendment:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create Contract Amendment",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/contract-amendments",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "json_schema_version",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Version of the form schema"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a Contract Amendment request.\n\nThis endpoint requires and returns country-specific data. The exact required and returned fields will\nvary depending on which country the employment is in. To see the list of parameters for each country,\nsee the **Show form schema** endpoint under the [Contract Amendments](#tag/Contract-Amendments) category.\n\nPlease note that the compliance requirements for each country are subject to change according to local\nlaws. Given its continual updates, using Remote"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Show Contract Amendment",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/contract-amendments/:id",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "93t3j-contract_amendment_id-9suej43",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Contract amendment request ID"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Show a single Contract Amendment request.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage employments (`employments`) | View contract amendments (`contract_amendment:read`) | Manage contract amendments (`contract_amendment:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Automatable Contract Amendment",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/contract-amendments/automatable",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "json_schema_version",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Version of the form schema"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Check if a contract amendment request is automatable.\nIf the contract amendment request is automatable, then after submission, it will instantly amend the employee's contract\nand send them an updated document.\n\nThis endpoint requires and returns country-specific data. The exact required and returned fields will\nvary depending on which country the employment is in. To see the list of parameters for each country,\nsee the **Show form schema** endpoint under the [Contract Amendments](#tag/Contract-A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}